            "id" : 13,
            "page number" : 1,
            "bounding box" : [ 99.239, 204.25, 496.089, 240.394 ],
            "font" : "SFRM1000",
            "font size" : 9.963,
            "text color" : "[0.0]",
            "content" : "We will often use Lemma 2.13 with X = [0,1], noting that Lipb([0,1]) = W1,∞((0,1)). For general open sets U however, we have a slightly diﬀerent characterisation for weak∗ convergence in W1,∞(U)."
